Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darko Ch.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.12,0:01:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.84,0:01:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hid the fifth Destiny Stone\Nfrom Arukenemon and Mummymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Black Wargreymon found\Nit easily and blasted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.92,0:01:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK had another meltdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He once had to watch Patamon get\Ndestroyed, and he's never gotten over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sixth Destiny Stone was\Nat the bottom of the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.64,0:01:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Black Wargreymon got to that one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I couldn't hurt\Nhim because he had a heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still stood up to him and said, If\Nyou want to destroy the Destiny Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.20,0:01:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll have to destroy me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the last time I try that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, Angemon saved me before Blackmore\NGreymon smashed the Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now there's only one left.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.22,0:02:09.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fscx120\fscy120\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(316,322)}The Steel Angel, Shakkoumon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agane no Tenshi, Shakkoumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.20,0:02:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, we can't just stand around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one Destiny Stone left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.14,0:02:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta find him before Blackmore\NGreymon does and totally loses his cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I'm going to lose my\Ncool if you keep calling me dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Ken has to\Nhelp his mother clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says go on ahead with\NAdam and he'll join up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.84,0:02:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with us when he finishes\Nvacuuming the chimney.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what happened to Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think he got pushed in a locker?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we were worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was helping clean up\Nthe teacher's lunchroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.30,0:02:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be helping us\Nfind the last destiny stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.76,0:02:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, between you and Ken, we must\Nbe running a cleaning service here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.68,0:02:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, talk about getting dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You late?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:02:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.07,0:03:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Gate, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.86,0:03:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't waste any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mission is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That destiny stone is here somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm going to find it if I have\Nto destroy everything in my path.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black tornado!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you be as\Npowerful as him, Mummymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've got charm and class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't tell me you're falling\Nfor that prefabricated hunk of shrapnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to bother\Nwith all that nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that's such a big relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should just destroy everything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, if we don't get moving that bucket\Nof bolts This is going to incinerate us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, wake up, Mamemon, I need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd never come\Naround, give us a kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone ever tell you you have bad breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, that's impossible, I think I brushed\Nmy tooth at least a year ago, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Face, the guy's not a rocket scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black War Greymon will\Nnever find us in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you want is some\Ndelicious Chinese soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, try it, you'll like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my specialty, egg drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose I could do a bit of\Nshopping while I'm here in Chinatown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.84,0:05:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I really need is\Na nice pair of sandals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That could be hard, considering\Nyou have eight sticky feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.66,0:05:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.24,0:05:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't need any comments\Nfrom you, sticky tape boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.02,0:05:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that I'm sensitive about my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.78,0:05:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just giving you a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love your feet, even your pointy toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.20,0:05:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough with the feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that tasty aroma? Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, it's incredible. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chinese soup, let's go\Nand get some. Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can even get some\Nextra hot soup to go and give it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to Black War Greymon so he can\Nscald his mouth when he eats it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:05:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're hot, you're hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.08,0:06:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, I hope they have fortune\Ncookies, they're my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what'll it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.78,0:06:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Taperman and I'll be your waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better leave me a big tip or next\Ntime you'll have a fly in your wonton.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.34,0:06:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want some soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, extra flies for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.74,0:06:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally a customer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, Blackwar Greymon's in close range.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.56,0:06:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Ken Putaway's dust\Ndragon is able to find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give Ken a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, plumminess\Nis next to digginess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.02,0:06:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.93,0:06:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kari, want some mineral water?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mineral water, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, Oli, since when\Ndid you get so healthy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since our family started\Nselling it in our store.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's full of vitamins and\Nminerals for good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time you're in my family's grocery\Nstore, be sure to pick up a bottle or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:06:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this, a commercial? Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since those guys have\Nbeen able to DNA digivolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if they've become much closer friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll DNA digivolve\Nwith the best of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.98,0:07:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon and Armadimon\Nhave been practicing hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.54,0:07:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're about to\Nmaster it at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armapad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pat-a-Arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, check out that\Nscrumptious smell. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.64,0:07:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.09,0:07:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stomach is growling with sheer delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine's growling with sheer hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not gonna pass on good food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, it's not often we\Nfind ourselves in Digi-Chinatown,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.40,0:07:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we may as well enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.26,0:07:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.22,0:07:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should all go in\Ntogether for the lunch special.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way you get a lot more food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want mine as spicy as we can make it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.11,0:08:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.38,0:08:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black Orr Greymon is out there\Nlooking for the last Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like we should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, they're all in there. Eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.32,0:08:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stuffing themselves with egg foo young.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Cody...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thing is, I love egg foo young.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a Tailmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling that the\Nreason you and Patamon haven't been
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,able to DNA Digivolve is because\NI'm too serious all of the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll try to lighten up\Nby the time dessert comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say, this soup is magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And full of flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need something, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, my good mom, what\Nis this tasty soup made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lots of noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.04,0:08:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.95,0:08:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even more noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't getting us anywhere at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's got noodles on the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to talk to your manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.62,0:08:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.96,0:08:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the owner, Digitamamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:09:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stupid waiter wouldn't tell us\Nwhat this delicious soup is made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's a secret recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.85,0:09:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I told you my recipe, it wouldn't\Nbe a secret anymore, now would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.02,0:09:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What insolence?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea who\Nyou're talking to, Buster?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More gifts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, rats, those kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DG Tomamon, it's nice to see you\Nagain, but I've kinda lost my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.86,0:09:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, just\Nremember there's always takeout.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're feeling better, you'll have\Na little Mushu, maybe a little Pupu,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or just for fun, I'll even\Nthrow in some almond cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a nice trip to the moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.34,0:09:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters Digimon are the champions
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Digital monsters\NDigimon are the champions
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fee-mon, Digivolve, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are the champions, xFee-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.50,0:10:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters, Digimon,\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.64,0:10:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.55,0:10:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D3G1
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ogmon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.78,0:10:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,G2G1 D4G1 D4G1 Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ankylomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor-Enerdine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geptimon, Armors, Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.56,0:11:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farmer! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nefertimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.61,0:11:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angel of light!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast ring! Green paw!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:11:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you find me, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sneak-bending!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't, Stingmon's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.80,0:12:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to Ken, did\Nhe decide to become a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll bust up and then\Ntake them both down. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.80,0:12:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukidarumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.64,0:12:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try again. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.74,0:13:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this proves one theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.44,0:13:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon have to have plenty to eat\Nbefore they're able to DNA Digibomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better think of something real fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.78,0:13:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did Digivolve. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.94,0:13:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's in that soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.89,0:13:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but if I were\Nyou, I wouldn't order the soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's follow him. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:13:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.34,0:14:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be focused on what's most\Nimportant and chasing them isn't what we
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,need to be concerned with right now We\Nall have to replenish our energy that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can DNA did you ball and get\Nready to meet black war Grame on I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could use a snack
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say, let's have something\Nto eat. Cody's right, hey dudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not complaining We\Nneed food! Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.66,0:14:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, we don't have anyone to cook\Nfor us, did you tell them on left?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not helpless!\NWe'll cook for ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.16,0:14:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll do our share and set the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.32,0:14:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we can add some onions and mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about some tuna fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you turn on the stove?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be the radiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just put water in it\Nfive years ago. Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing that'll\Nsave it now is water!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.54,0:15:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mummy Mod, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mummy Mod! Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea, you twit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.18,0:15:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water dripping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.44,0:15:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Drippy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.48,0:15:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sound's coming from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.22,0:15:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there, just a little farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hooray, the swimming pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.78,0:15:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stink after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that smells good\Nenough to eat. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sign over there says\Nit's the Chinese soup spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.78,0:16:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're looking at a jumbo pot of soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where that\Nirresistible soup was made
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my stomach's telling\Nme I've got to have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No slurping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.66,0:16:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, don't you have any manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No slimy tongues allowed in the soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a law against\Ndrinking soup around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.98,0:16:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drinking this soup is strictly forbidden
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you don't want to\Nknow the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's baloney!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes me want to have\Nsome of it even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.92,0:16:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're not gonna stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I hope that's not a\Ngiant fly seeking revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, nice time for a swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either this is a destiny stone\Nor it's a giant monster ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.30,0:17:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've ruined the soup\Nand the Destiny Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.52,0:17:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad for a bunch of kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing the chef left bra.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.22,0:17:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but we added a special touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.40,0:17:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, everybody's hands went in the soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.20,0:17:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tastes better that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something strange about this\Nsoup, Cody. I have this weird feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we'll figure out how to DNA Digivolve
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be the MSG
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd it go dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the light of a Destiny Stone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.38,0:18:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A perfect turn of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.46,0:18:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the digital world will be my oyster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I need my black pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.03,0:18:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a mushroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop my nose! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The final Destiny Stone... I hope you\Ncame for the soup? I'll shatter it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pieces stop figures those nosy kids\Nalways show up at the wrong time don't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.14,0:18:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,try it or we'll turn you into a heap\Nof sardine kids you just never seem
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.98,0:18:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to learn your lesson do you obnoxious\Nparasites show them what you're
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:19:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need you to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.30,0:19:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, I think the time has come for\Nus to put that big guy away. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.02,0:19:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready whenever you are, Angemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.81,0:19:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's let her rip.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Payback time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save some for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-B-mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Airdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a serious demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get him! I'm you! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.02,0:19:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.16,0:19:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digiball 2! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silky Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.70,0:20:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Destroyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.92,0:20:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Static Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.16,0:20:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it all you've got! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ankylomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
